  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I noticed that the position of the upper part of the body is not the same client side and server side.\nThis happened regardless of the use of full body tracking or not (I did not test with desktop users).\nFor example, i touched a friend's nose, he said that was his eye. He touched my nose, from my side (looking at a mirror and camera) he was touching my cheek.\nMy guess would be that the new IK system has been implemented in the client side of the app, but not in the server side, so for everyone else, its aligning the avatar differently.\nIn any case, this needs some work around.",
